      "input": "Thanks *he said to them, after which he decides to give them back the boots*\nYou'll need them more than me",
      "outcome": "success",
      "exception": null,
      "narration": "Blackthorn blinks at the returned boots, her impatience briefly visible in the tightness around her eyes. \"Suit yourself,\" she says, and tucks them back under her arm without further comment.\n\nThe square's moderate foot traffic flows past, a few passers-by glancing toward Heartstone's massive old entrance before continuing on their way. The low residential buildings surrounding the square give way to narrower streets beyond, and the squat facade of The Coined Lie sits visible somewhere nearby. Blackthorn's posture suggests she has not finished whatever business brought her here.",
